<Base title="About">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Hi, I’m Kay.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm a Machine Learning engineer based in the UK.
      </p>

      <p>
        While investigating longstanding neuromuscular symptoms, my genetic testing turned up a variant of uncertain significance (VUS).
      </p>
      <p>
      With more questions than answers, I started wondering whether I could use my background in AI to make sense of some of the uncertainty.
      </p>
      <p>
        One rabbit hole led to another, and I found myself learning about genetics, protein structures, and computational biology.
      </p>

      <p>
        This blog is where I document my learnings, share my investigations, and explore whether I can better understand my condition-- and perhaps even find a cure for it someday.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
